OL,3,GNEWSA'Loneliest dog' finds home after 3
OL,4,Ayears in kennels
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog rescued from a property where she
OL,7,Fwas being kept with 200 others has
OL,8,Ffound a new home after nearly three
OL,9,Fyears in kennels.
OL,11,FCollie cross Sadie was rescued by the
OL,12,FRSPCA after being found living in
OL,13,Funsuitable conditions in outdoor
OL,14,Fcompounds in Cornwall, the charity
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThe five-year-old dog could not be
OL,18,Frehomed immediately due to legal
OL,19,Fprocesses. But once cleared for
OL,20,Fadoption she was still in RSPCA kennels
OL,21,Fafter 1,000 days with staff describing
OL,22,Fher as "Britain's loneliest dog".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
