OL,3,GNEWSA'Loneliest dog' finds home after 3
OL,4,Ayears in kennels
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a bid to find her forever home, they
OL,7,Fposted a video a day of Sadie on social
OL,8,Fmedia. On day 83, Mabel Edge from
OL,9,FWestward Ho! in Devon stumbled across
OL,10,Fone of the clips before decided she
OL,11,Fwould adopt her.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
